          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will a face oil make my skin greasy?",
            "answer": "<p>No. The blend is lightweight and absorbs in seconds. Start with 2–3 drops on damp skin; a little goes a long way.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use it on oily or acne-prone skin?",
            "answer": "<p>Many people with oily skin enjoy lightweight oils like jojoba and squalane. As with any new product, patch test first.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where does it fit in my routine?",
            "answer": "<p>Use it as your last skincare step at night, and before SPF in the morning. You can also mix a drop into your moisturiser.</p>"
          }
        },
